OL,3,GNEWSASMA newborn screening trial a
OL,4,A'major step forward'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new NHS newborn screening programme
OL,7,Fto identify babies with Spinal Muscular
OL,8,FAtrophy (SMA) before they develop
OL,9,Fsymptoms has been described as a "major
OL,10,Fstep forward" for those affected.
OL,12,FThe Robert Jones and Agnes Hunt
OL,13,FOrthopaedic Hospital (RJAH) in
OL,14,FShropshire is working with Birmingham
OL,15,FHeartlands Hospital as part of a
OL,16,Fnational trial, assessing whether SMA
OL,17,Fshould be added to the routine newborn
OL,18,Fblood spot, or heel-prick test.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
