OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1791217574
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSASMA newborn screening trial a
OL,4,A'major step forward'
OL,5,
OL,6,FProf Tracey Willis, consultant
OL,7,Fpaediatric neurologist at RJAH, said:
OL,8,F"The earlier you can start treatment,
OL,9,Fthe better.
OL,11,F"We've been campaigning for a long time
OL,12,Fto get SMA put on that list, because
OL,13,Fwe've got effective treatments now."
